{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_title", "source_sha256": "b6d51eee2951498a6a06f755e7004f7f56ad741dfe5145c8a910a3279f95f621", "ja": "新たな物語！", "zh": "全新故事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b6ffeea586d74fa28d88eda6c1d0bdcc10cb414b4ee12dbc95cf4329f8a52366", "ja": "『バニーポリス』シリーズ続編ドラマの\n完成披露イベントに出演する海美と恵美。\n不安と期待を胸にファンの皆の前に立つ、\nアイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "出演《バニーポリス》系列续作电视剧完成披露活动的海美和惠美。\n怀抱着不安与期待，站在所有粉丝面前的偶像们的一个片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bc813d3f49e4fa89e2acffcbb1d020c4bb9c2297fef8f5768b0f73804744d3ba", "ja": "（『バニーポリス』シリーズの新作ドラマ。\n今日は、その完成披露イベントだ）", "zh": "（《兔警官》系列的新作电视剧。今天是它的完成披露活动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "2049e31c1c2828f00d7ad160a0393479c11c64aa6e4fb5aa03d97e56c6030ef7", "ja": "そわそわ、そわそわ……。\nうう～っ、落ち着かないよーっ！", "zh": "坐立不安，坐立不安……\n呜呜～，静不下心来啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "7bb8baf1fe48f1b443bcacbbf15557d4051e203e10f96bcf44854c5a7744a290", "ja": "もー。海美ってば、今からそんなんじゃ、\n本番までもたないよ～？", "zh": "真是的。海美你现在就这样，\n怎么撑得到正式开拍呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "5d579a8c3c593453d5fb10e4ad013485d33ed85b1d22178c4b1897b06b94ecdd", "ja": "だってー！　めぐみー、{$P$}。\nみんな、今回のドラマ楽しみにしてる……よね？", "zh": "因为嘛——！恵美——，{$P$}。大家都很期待这次的剧……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "12790eb0d0a213fe86b7c50ca72373c5f1103f7c1a9e1646fdc937a826d26648", "ja": "そりゃそうでしょ！　アタシたちがやった\n『バニーポリス』の、待望の続編だもん。", "zh": "那当然啦！这可是我们演的《兔子警察》备受期待的续篇嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "f918762affc5fb4a76cb2d58f5fa984f1a339e49299aa4c9c1d31c68be672b2a", "ja": "だ、だよね……ううっ。", "zh": "对、对吧……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2dfdaa5dc0481a7e3909b70c2b200490abdfd1b5a6bd9762e5d38c57201cd674", "ja": "海美の演じる新キャラも目玉のひとつだしな。\nSNSを見る限り、かなり話題になってるみたいだ。", "zh": "由海美饰演的新角色也是一大看点。\n从SNS上的反响来看，好像相当受关注。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "f89b936b31bfed227560e4bca7cc74a389d77460d95419ef1f5f552628bcba79", "ja": "お～。やったじゃん、海美！\n今日のライブも、バッチリ決めないとねっ♪", "zh": "哦～干得漂亮嘛，海美！\n今天的演出也要完美发挥才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "9b0cce2885aca5647a3874c501401bb396c279036b405d7a57e474cb6f4a69d5", "ja": "……って、あれ、海美～？\nおーい、どうかしたの？", "zh": "……等等，哎呀，海美～？\n喂～，你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "b56871c83ca3c64e8f1615919a252c8dd5e58d1a2c7f5478aff7e6251669e52a", "ja": "うぅ……めぐみー、{$P$}。\n私、なんか緊張してきちゃったみたい……。", "zh": "呜呜……惠，{$P$}。\n我好像突然有点紧张起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "336e4b6c0d7eda7de21e13a28d9b2007a18675db2676ec17d9bf2ed574423ca1", "ja": "ええっ！？　海美がそわそわしてたのって、\n早く歌いたいからじゃなかったの！？", "zh": "诶！？海美刚才坐立不安的，难道不是因为想早点唱歌吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "058ac6b06f69ba44f04ef90c7ac8fd4ef18ed6533b4de3cd96b0090c10b63ab9", "ja": "それもあるんだけど！　でもでも、あのお芝居を\nみんなに見られるんだーって思ったら、なんか……！", "zh": "确实也有这个原因！不过，不过，一想到大家会看到那场戏，就觉得有点……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "f6da5e70e753402630c5194fd90bedd8df77b8b6652491c4de57dcd92204812c", "ja": "あー……。", "zh": "啊——……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5b4df2117d896894b528774251f344274d6cce41cdfba0fd0f8b58809ef142b7", "ja": "なるほど、そういう事か。\n確かに、今回は少し挑戦的な役だもんな。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么回事啊。\n确实，这次的角色有点挑战性呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "69472ad995a8a6d4508373d60b595c6d71a4e8b580383b13aacb90ef392bc426", "ja": "それでかー。でも海美、今までだって\n自分と違う性格の役をやったコト、あるっしょ？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。不过海美，你以前也演过和自己性格不一样的角色吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "4e67dbcbd55ec6b65334242f38266db3a7ec3342638dfbae36c6c65169c80045", "ja": "うん。でも、ここまで違うっていうか、\nドSっていうのは初めてだから……。", "zh": "嗯。不过，要说差别这么大的角色，还是第一次演，尤其还是超级抖S的类型……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "ee7345d55d40cf53efc02b548f66e20b2c01c45cbefb8f43aa17c04142f9fa90", "ja": "なんか見てくれた人が、思ってたのと違うーって\nなっちゃったりしないかな？って、心配だよーっ！", "zh": "会不会有看过的人觉得和自己想象的不一样啊？我有点担心——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "a6021f41c201f4ac267f94642cf2f29603ea93ca6f8db9edaf6a45fd648632ea", "ja": "そりゃ、想像と違ったって人はいるだろうけど……。", "zh": "确实，应该会有人觉得和想象的不一样吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "d4d6ac3cacdfbaf8222e9916ed1e1a3dc3cb5d7914e7cba748d6faf3f3ad082d", "ja": "うう、だよねー……。", "zh": "嗯嗯，确实呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "716801e7a6c68c1d9f112f0c75dca8ebe9a215adf287ba8cbb9cf2ec26918ee5", "ja": "えーでも新キャラなんだから、想像と違うも何も、\nって感じじゃない？　それにさー、えっと……。", "zh": "诶——但毕竟是新角色，根本谈不上和想象中不一样吧？而且呢——那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "5058a74d481a6f6e66af2eb487f9192c8cf4045dc37b624d587ed0b502c5e2fc", "ja": "えっと……うーん、ダメだ！\n{$P$}、バトンタッチ！", "zh": "那个……嗯——不行！\n{$P$}，交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "081407a62f40310df60f8e87eeb20d802c1bb971e681e140d1dc088c0a376870", "ja": "はは、わかったよ。……それでいいんだよ、海美。\n恵美が言うとおり、海美は新キャラなんだから。", "zh": "哈哈，知道了。……这样就好，海美。\n正如惠美所说，海美可是新角色嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7fed0c23a66afec9d44d20cf4f470cbb5133a9cf2139c00a615f7214a3077d25", "ja": "想像と違うのは悪い事じゃなくて、寧ろ驚きだ。\nいい意味で、期待を裏切っていけばいいんだよ。", "zh": "和想象的不一样并不是什么坏事，反而会让人惊喜。  \n就这样以好的方式不断打破期待就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "3352e7bf69a47e3aeabd5f922b929583ae3ce82bb7d76838f362286eb5843ae3", "ja": "そうそう、それが言いたかったの！　それにそっちのが\nいいっていうか、楽しくない？　サプライズじゃん！", "zh": "对对，这就是我想说的！而且那样不是更好吗？或者说，更有趣？这不就是惊喜嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "6eacd063dea474dc7f33142bb9ce79c8b02d8f1dcfaa7504d6639c01533341cd", "ja": "あっ、そっか。……さすが、\n{$P$}とめぐみーだね！", "zh": "啊，原来如此。……不愧是\n{$P$}和惠惠！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "1076435bce62f7e017f5f6a655b321f162d2138371499a237b7d507bf436b247", "ja": "いつもと違う私を、みんなに……サプライズで\n楽しんでもらえるように……うんっ！", "zh": "为了能让大家……以惊喜的形式，\n去享受和平时不一样的我……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "65d28929701bf66dfb36c924330c23d4c57e4e5db09c78a27d8c42cac1f091a0", "ja": "そう考えたら、なんか楽しみになってきたかも！\nうー、待ちきれないよー！", "zh": "这么一想，好像开始有点期待了！\n呜——已经等不及啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "16739ba032bd9ae3b815ccc56f7973f964f1ecb02a3cfaa45dca9994842decd0", "ja": "お、いつものそわそわに戻ったみたいだな。\nそれじゃふたりとも、よろしくな！", "zh": "哦，看来你又恢复平时那副坐立不安的样子了。\n那么，你们两个就拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "56a444b9d58a177be6f93aa9fd86cca9cedc885c3a64603fa982f5372ac06844", "ja": "「お前だけは、絶対に逃がさない！」\nバニーポリス、副隊長役の所恵美です！", "zh": "“绝不会放跑你这家伙！”\n我是饰演兔女郎警察副队长的所惠美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "9a9f8f074dc1710d22789008b81c03253958aee55f7fa3876ce6db59f8f7c060", "ja": "「ねえ子ウサギちゃん。遊びましょう？」\n新キャラ、シンジケート役の高坂海美です！", "zh": "「小兔子，要一起玩吗？」\n饰演新角色“辛迪加”的高坂海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "ac0f9b374decadbb8544a8bb230046130a6b1e2c0c9bf34b2071d4c0d85eda44", "ja": "今日は、アタシ達のステージを～……", "zh": "今天，就请尽情享受我们的舞台吧～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_132_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_132_ng_01_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "1f047379f637353e8bcbe1c10ab90d9af47f62e36506081e2a0c49bd4decb0cf", "ja": "最後まで、楽しんでいってね～☆", "zh": "请大家尽情享受到最后哦～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
